@Module.Timing.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5063

GET {{Module.Timing.Api_HostAddress}}/weatherforecast/
Accept: application/json

###

### Cross-domain administration read; use authoritative Statistics entry transponder and bounds
@transponderId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_ACCESS_TOKEN
GET {{Module.Timing.Api_HostAddress}}/api/timing/passings?transponderId={{transponderId}}&from=2026-11-17T08:00:00Z&to=2026-11-17T08:10:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Accept: application/json

### Exactly seven days is supported (encode a plus offset as %2B00:00)
GET {{Module.Timing.Api_HostAddress}}/api/timing/passings?transponderId={{transponderId}}&from=2026-11-10T08:00:00%2B00:00&to=2026-11-17T08:00:00Z
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
